SEMAPHORE SIGNAL CARD
message: SEMAPHORE
row: letter | left / right | crossed | mnemonic
----------------------------------------------
S | NE / E | [X] | left arm reaches over, high
E | NW / S | [ ] | left arm high, right at rest
M | NE / SE | [X] | left arm reaches over the body
A | S / SE | [ ] | left arm at rest, right low
P | W / E | [ ] | both arms straight out
H | SW / SE | [ ] | both arms low, a wide V
O | SW / E | [ ] | left low, right straight out
R | N / E | [ ] | left straight up, right out
E | NW / S | [ ] | left arm high, right at rest
----------------------------------------------
shape classes        XH -H XH -- -- -- -- -H -H
contains a vowel     yes
even arm crossings   yes
neighbours distinct  no
